WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:23.646
"We're going to a fancy restaurant," said Mom.

2
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:30.236
"I want everyone to look nice."

3
00:00:30.237 --> 00:00:37.391
Emmy put on a pretty dress.

4
00:00:37.392 --> 00:00:40.524
The dress was white with pink flowers.

5
00:00:40.525 --> 00:00:48.261
She put on her best shoes.

6
00:00:48.262 --> 00:00:53.988
Harry put on his favorite sweater.

7
00:00:53.989 --> 00:01:00.682
Oliver put on a nice shirt and pants.

8
00:01:00.683 --> 00:01:07.149
Then he put his favorite toy car in his pocket.

9
00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:11.131
The kids were ready.

10
00:01:11.132 --> 00:01:22.372
But Mom and Dad were not ready.

11
00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:27.444
The kids waited.

12
00:01:27.445 --> 00:01:34.471
Soon Dad was ready, but Mom was not.

13
00:01:34.472 --> 00:01:37.341
"Can we go outside?" asked Emmy.

14
00:01:37.342 --> 00:01:40.048
"Sure," said Dad.

15
00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:49.480
"But don't get dirty."

16
00:01:49.481 --> 00:01:53.563
Emmy, Harry, and Oliver went outside.

17
00:01:53.564 --> 00:01:57.025
Puddles were everywhere.

18
00:01:57.026 --> 00:02:02.141
"Puddles!" said Oliver.

19
00:02:02.142 --> 00:02:07.103
Oliver ran toward a puddle.

20
00:02:07.104 --> 00:02:10.558
"No, Oliver!" said Emmy.

21
00:02:10.559 --> 00:02:17.681
"We need to look nice."

22
00:02:17.682 --> 00:02:21.140
"Mud!" said Oliver.

23
00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:25.935
He ran toward the big muddy area.

24
00:02:25.936 --> 00:02:31.095
"We can't get dirty, Oliver!" said Harry.

25
00:02:31.096 --> 00:02:36.709
Now Mom was ready.

26
00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:39.846
"Where are the kids?" she asked.

27
00:02:39.847 --> 00:02:43.701
"Outside," said Dad.

28
00:02:43.702 --> 00:02:47.532
"Oh no!" said Mom.

29
00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:51.783
"The kids will get dirty!"

30
00:02:51.784 --> 00:03:02.122
Mom and Dad ran outside.

31
00:03:02.123 --> 00:03:05.299
But the kids were still clean!

32
00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:12.659
"Whew!" said Mom.

33
00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:16.958
The restaurant was very fancy.

34
00:03:16.959 --> 00:03:24.763
"Don't we all look nice?" asked Mom.

35
00:03:24.764 --> 00:03:31.699
"Oops," said Dad.
